/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Constrained\040Willmore\040surfaces)
/Author (Christoph\040Bohle\054\040G\056\040Paul\040Peters\054\040Ulrich\040Pinkall)
/Subject (Constrained\040Willmore\040surfaces\040are\040conformal\040immersions\040of\040Riemann\040surfaces\040that\040are\040critical\040points\040of\040the\040Willmore\040energy\040\044\044\173\134mathcal\173W\175\175\040\075\040\134int\040H\1362\044\044\012\040under\040compactly\040supported\040infinitesimal\040conformal\040variations\056\040Examples\040include\040all\040constant\040mean\040curvature\040surfaces\040in\040space\040forms\056\040In\040this\040paper\040we\040investigate\040more\040generally\040the\040critical\040points\040of\040arbitrary\040geometric\040functionals\040on\040the\040space\040of\040immersions\040under\040the\040constraint\040that\040the\040admissible\040variations\040infinitesimally\040preserve\040the\040conformal\040structure\056\040Besides\040constrained\040Willmore\040surfaces\040we\040discuss\040in\040some\040detail\040examples\040of\040constrained\040minimal\040and\040volume\040critical\040surfaces\054\040the\040critical\040points\040of\040the\040area\040and\040enclosed\040volume\040functional\040under\040the\040conformal\040constraint\056)
/Keywords (12\040Jan\0402008\054\040Calculus\040of\040Variations\040and\040Partial\040Differential\040Equations\054\040Willmore\040energy\054\040Mean\040curvature\054\040Conformal\040map\054\040Riemann\040surface\054\040Technical\040University\040of\040Berlin)
>>
